      howToRun: 'Prayer + the anchor (5): pray; read Proverbs 21:5 and 28:20-22. | The idea in a sentence (10): haste means closing before the truth arrives. | Teach it (15): thoughts versus work rate, then the unweighed downside and who pays it. | Work it (20): for one live deal, list what is unverified with a date beside each, against the closing date. | Discussion (10): whose urgency are we actually responding to? | Send-off (5): solo task — verify one item on that list this week.',
